<view class="page">
    <view class="glow"></view>

    <view class="ghead">
        <view class="gh-l">
            <text class="gh-title">全球市场</text>
            <text class="gh-sub">指数 · 期货 · 贵金属 · 汇率</text>
        </view>
        <view class="gh-r">
            <view class="gh-state {{cacheOnly ? 'warn' : ''}}">
                <view class="gh-dot"></view>
                <text>{{stateText}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="gh-clock num">{{clock}}</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="srcwarn" wx:if="{{warn}}">
        <view class="sw-l">
            <text class="sw-t">{{warn}}</text>
            <text class="sw-s" wx:if="{{warnHint}}">{{warnHint}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sw-btn" wx:if="{{warnDomain}}" bindtap="copyDomain">复制域名</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="key">
        <view class="card-head">
            <text class="card-title">{{item.title}}</text>
            <text class="card-tag">{{item.sub}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="q-row" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="q" wx:key="key" bindtap="openDetail" data-key="{{q.key}}">
            <view class="q-l">
                <text class="q-name">{{q.name}}</text>
                <text class="q-sub">{{q.subText}}</text>
            </view>
            <view class="q-r">
                <text class="q-price num {{q.cls}}">{{q.priceText}}</text>
                <text class="q-pct num {{q.cls}}">{{q.pctText}}</text>
            </view>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="foot">
        <text>数据来源：东方财富 · 腾讯行情 · 新浪财经。外盘与港股期货含夜盘，数值有延迟，仅作方向参考。</text>
        <text>涨跌配色按 A 股习惯：红涨绿跌。下拉可手动刷新，停留本页每 20 秒自动更新。</text>
    </view>
</view>
